{"4281320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alien Colony", "steam_appid": 4281320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5131670], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. A TACTICAL ACTION GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien Colony</strong> is a 2.5D tactical action-horror game where you command a squad of clones fighting as a single unit. Fight your way through a mining colony devastated by a deadly parasite, make the most of your soldiers' special weapons, and carefully analyze every situation to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/ff3161f51df9ee27dad193deed07b4f3.poster.avif?t=1787904409\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/ff3161f51df9ee27dad193deed07b4f3.webm?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/ff3161f51df9ee27dad193deed07b4f3.mp4?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. PUZZLES TO SOLVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a drone to infiltrate areas inaccessible to your soldiers. Solve puzzles requiring both strategy and agility to unlock paths and overcome obstacles blocking your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/cd9251a0bee963f7dbe624e7fd222b92.poster.avif?t=1787904409\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/cd9251a0bee963f7dbe624e7fd222b92.webm?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/cd9251a0bee963f7dbe624e7fd222b92.mp4?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. HIDE TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes stealth is the most effective way to survive. Hide from powerful enemies or avoid detection by the colony's security systems to complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/8bf1d7bdfc9ac5fb37b6af1d0c6e47b8.poster.avif?t=1787904409\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/8bf1d7bdfc9ac5fb37b6af1d0c6e47b8.webm?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/8bf1d7bdfc9ac5fb37b6af1d0c6e47b8.mp4?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. PHILOSOPHICAL CHOICES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Alien Colony</strong>, horror is born from dehumanization: colonists transformed into hosts by alien parasites, and cloned soldiers treated as mere resources by a ruthless corporation. In this world, every life is valued only for its usefulness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, your soldiers will face difficult choices. Will they obey the Company's orders or question them? Every decision will shape the story, influence the relationships within your squad, and determine the outcome of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is never the end. A new clone squad will resume the mission exactly where the previous one failed, inheriting its memories, its experience... and its fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Company promises the clones that once their mission is complete, they will finally earn their freedom. But what is freedom worth when it is granted by those who created you? Can you truly be free if you were designed to obey? And if your memories are transferred into a new body, are you still the same person?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/7f38fc01aa2265fbdd22c91354afb4d1.poster.avif?t=1787904409\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/7f38fc01aa2265fbdd22c91354afb4d1.webm?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/7f38fc01aa2265fbdd22c91354afb4d1.mp4?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. A TACTICAL ACTION GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien Colony</strong> is a 2.5D tactical action-horror game where you command a squad of clones fighting as a single unit. Fight your way through a mining colony devastated by a deadly parasite, make the most of your soldiers' special weapons, and carefully analyze every situation to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/ff3161f51df9ee27dad193deed07b4f3.poster.avif?t=1787904409\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/ff3161f51df9ee27dad193deed07b4f3.webm?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/ff3161f51df9ee27dad193deed07b4f3.mp4?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. PUZZLES TO SOLVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a drone to infiltrate areas inaccessible to your soldiers. Solve puzzles requiring both strategy and agility to unlock paths and overcome obstacles blocking your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/cd9251a0bee963f7dbe624e7fd222b92.poster.avif?t=1787904409\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/cd9251a0bee963f7dbe624e7fd222b92.webm?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/cd9251a0bee963f7dbe624e7fd222b92.mp4?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. HIDE TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes stealth is the most effective way to survive. Hide from powerful enemies or avoid detection by the colony's security systems to complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/8bf1d7bdfc9ac5fb37b6af1d0c6e47b8.poster.avif?t=1787904409\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/8bf1d7bdfc9ac5fb37b6af1d0c6e47b8.webm?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/8bf1d7bdfc9ac5fb37b6af1d0c6e47b8.mp4?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. PHILOSOPHICAL CHOICES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Alien Colony</strong>, horror is born from dehumanization: colonists transformed into hosts by alien parasites, and cloned soldiers treated as mere resources by a ruthless corporation. In this world, every life is valued only for its usefulness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, your soldiers will face difficult choices. Will they obey the Company's orders or question them? Every decision will shape the story, influence the relationships within your squad, and determine the outcome of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is never the end. A new clone squad will resume the mission exactly where the previous one failed, inheriting its memories, its experience... and its fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Company promises the clones that once their mission is complete, they will finally earn their freedom. But what is freedom worth when it is granted by those who created you? Can you truly be free if you were designed to obey? And if your memories are transferred into a new body, are you still the same person?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/7f38fc01aa2265fbdd22c91354afb4d1.poster.avif?t=1787904409\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/7f38fc01aa2265fbdd22c91354afb4d1.webm?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281320/extras/7f38fc01aa2265fbdd22c91354afb4d1.mp4?t=1787904409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Lead a squad of four cloned marines through an infected mining colony where every death creates a new soldier, but slowly destroys what remains of your humanity.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil, R